    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omukyeno gwa Pasuraha habw'okukwata Yeremiya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pasuhara nyakatagara mutabani wa Imeri, ow'akaba ali mulemi omukuru omunju ya MUKAMA, obuyahuliire Yeremiya naaranga ebintu ebi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaragira Yeremiya omurangi ateerwe, hanyuma akwatwe omu nkomo eya ha irembo eryatwaraga omunju ya MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro ekya kurasireho Pasuhara obu yaihire Yeremiya omu nkomo, Yeremiya yamugambira ati, “MUKAMA tarukukweta Pasuhara, baitu naakweta kagingo ha mbaju zoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba MUKAMA naagamba ati: Ninyija kukuleetera kwetiina iwe wenka n'okutiinwa banywani bawe. Abanyanzigwa baabu balibaisa empirima oroleriire oti. Yuda yoona ndigirekera omukama wa Bbabbulooni; alibanyaga abatwale Bbabbulooni abaise empirima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tindigarukira aho honka, obuguuda bwona obw'orubuga runu, amagoba gaarwo, ebintu byarwo byona eby'omuhendo, itungo lyona ery'abakama ba Yuda, byona abanyanzigwa baabu, babinyage, babikwate babitwale Bbabbulooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwe Pasuhara n'eka yawe yoona, mulinyagwa mutwarwe Bbabbulooni; oku nuho oligwa kandi nuho oliziikwa hamu na banywani bawe boona aba warangiire ebisuba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Empamo ya Yeremiya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremiya naakyeena ekiro yazaaliirwemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
